EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}That's quite a bold look you have
on today. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Are you trying to make
a fashion statement, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Because if you are,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} you should
totally let me give you a makeover!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
You'd look {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}SO good in all PINK!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hoy llevas un estilo diferente, ¿no?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}
¿Estás intentando cambiar de look?
¡Porque yo puedo ayudarte!
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}¡Creo que estarías ideal toda de
rosa!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Guarda un po' oggi come ti sei
conciata. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Vuoi sfondare nel mondo
della moda, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}?
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Cioè, posso darti un consiglio
in qualità di regina dello stile?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Il rosa ti starebbe troppo bene!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}That's very kind of you,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} but I'm
well aware of what colors look
best on me. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Maybe next time!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Eres muy amable,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} pero soy muy
consciente de qué color me queda
mejor. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Quizá en otra ocasión.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Je te remercie, mais je sais quelles
couleurs me vont.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}Et je préfère ne
pas abuser du rose...{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ti ringrazio per il tuo consiglio,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ma
conosco le tinte che più si adattano
alla mia carnagione. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Nessuna offesa!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Das ist zwar allerliebst von dir,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
jedoch wird das nicht nötig sein.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Ich weiß sehr wohl, welche Farben
mir stehen. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Aber vielleicht komme
ich einmal auf das Angebot zurück.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Çok naziksin,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ama bana en çok hangi
renklerin yakıştığını gayet iyi
biliyorum. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Belki başka sefere!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}¡No puedes limitarte a los colores
que te quedan bien, chica! {{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Hay que
innovar, arriesgarse!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Cioè, non puoi mica comprare solo
ciò che ti sta bene! Devi osare,
bellezza! È questo il trucco!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Oh, yo corro riesgos. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡El otro día
me armé de valor y me puse unos
zapatos sin calcetines!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}A dire il vero penso di osare, a mio
modo almeno. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Non ci crederai, ma
a volte non mi metto le calze!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Ich traue mich doch diverse Dinge.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Auf meine ganz eigene Art.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Gelegentlich trage ich zum Beispiel
Schuhe ohne Socken,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Hold on just a moment now!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
You never said anything to me{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
about forming a band.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}¡Alto ahí!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} ¿Se supone que yo
también estoy?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Es la primera
vez que oigo hablar del tema!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Minute !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Tu parles de nous deux ?{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}} À
quel moment aurais-je accepté de
former un groupe avec toi ?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Huch,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} nicht so hastig!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Seit wann
wollen wir eine Band gründen?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Von dieser Idee höre ich selbst
gerade zum ersten Mal!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Dans quoi est-ce que je suis en train
de m'embarquer ?!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Imagine qu'on ait
le trac,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}} et moi ?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}}¿Lo ves? Incluso a él le parece
una locura.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Una decisión así hay
que pensársela con calma.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Tu ne sais même pas {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}si {{TAG:0005:0008:}}
sait jouer du tambourin !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0028:}} Ce n'est
pas un instrument facile, tu sais.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0003:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Aber woher sollen wir denn wissen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ob {{TAG:0005:0008:}} überhaupt gut die
Triangel spielen kann?
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Gute Triangelspieler sind rar.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}}¡No hace falta! Ella puede hacer
cualquier cosa que se proponga.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Creo en vosotras, compañeras!

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}} is obviously intimidated
by the tambourine idea.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} If anything,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
